  "title": "Mexican Corn Salad",
  "description": "All the veggies in this salad - fresh corn, peppers, zucchini and onions - are chopped or diced, so the consistency is very much like salsa. Everything is sauteed in butter and then chilled, until ready to spoon onto a salad or into a warm tortilla with a dollop of sour cream.",
